    "directions": [
      "In a mug, whisk the matcha powder with the hot water until smooth. Stir in the syrup and add the steamed milk. Garnish.\nCaramel Apple Butter SyrupAdd the butters to a saucepan over medium heat. Once melted follow with caramel sauce and vanilla extract. Stir to combine and add the rest of the ingredients. Stir until clump-free. Will keep in the refrigerator for 2 weeks."
